<h1>Identity and access</h1>
<p>Map an authenticated chat subject to a principal, then grant an agent and its capabilities separately.</p>
</header>
<nav class="guide-jumps" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#identity">Caller mapping</a><a href="#policy">Worked decision</a><a href="#constraints">Execution limits</a><a href="#credentials">Credentials</a>
